DTSTAMP:20260709T094608Z
DTSTART:20260701T210000Z
SUMMARY:M/LCC 2 Implemented on Wednesday\, July 01\, 2026 at 17:00 in ALL OF NEW ENGLAND
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England is implementing Master Local Control Center Procedure No. 2 (M/LCC 2)\, Abnormal Conditions Alert\, on Wednesday\, July 01\, 2026 at 17:00 in ALL OF NEW ENGLAND due to Severe Weather.  Master Local Control Center Procedure No. 2 requests that you will not engage in activities that may jeopardize the availability of resources or transmission under your control.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164308
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164308
END:VEVENT
