SUMMARY:Forward Capacity Market Second Annual Reconfiguration Auction (w/ ARTs) for Capacity Commitment Period 2027 - 2028 to Open August 3\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:In accordance with Market Rule 1\, Section III.13.4.2\, the submission period for submitting bids and offers to the Forward Capacity Market Second Annual Reconfiguration Auction and Annual Reconfiguration Transactions for Capacity Commitment Period 2027-2028 will open on August 3\, 2026 (00:00) and will close on August 5\, 2026 (11:00).\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164313
