DTSTAMP:20260709T094608Z
DTSTART:20260703T040000Z
DTEND:20260704T035900Z
SUMMARY:Independence Day
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England observes this holiday:\n\n\n	Participant Support and most other departments are not staffed\n	Settlements will not be released and initial settlement metering deadlines will not fall on this day\n	The Credit department is closed\, along with Federal Reserve and BlackRock\n\n\nFor after-hours business emergencies\, contact Participant Support at (877) 226-4814 (pager). See Contact the ISO for other options.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161790
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161790
