BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:164389@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260709T094608Z
DTSTART:20260722T190000Z
SUMMARY:ISO New England will be performing a maintenance outage of the eMarket\, eFTR\, and DRMUI production environments on Wednesday\, July 22\, 2026\, from 15:00 to 18:00 Hrs
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England will be performing a maintenance outage of the eMarket\, eFTR\, and DRMUI production environments on Wednesday\, July 22\, 2026\, from 15:00 to 18:00 Hrs. During this time\, users may experience intermittent connectivity issues. There may be missing 5-minute Locational Marginal Prices (LMPs) and Regulation Clearing Prices (RCPs). Generating units and Demand Response Resources (DRRs) might receive stale DDP/DNE signals (on the RTUs) during this time.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164389
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164389
END:VEVENT
