SUMMARY:ISO 101: We are ISO New England
LOCATION:ISO New England\, 1 Sullivan Road\, Holyoke\, MA 01040 [Connecticut Training Room\, Sullivan South (2nd floor)]
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a dynamic one-day course designed to provide an overview of ISO New England and its role in grid operations\, market administration\, and power system planning.  This course is open to anyone in the power industry seeking to enhance their understanding of ISO New England's role and operations.\n\nSave the Date! Registration will be available approximately eight weeks before the class.\nContact: Market Training (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=160373
